four states that expect a REPUBLISH — `draft`, `changes_requested`, `stale`,
`conflicted` — keep refusing whatever their delta is, because the next snapshot
of the shared worktree would pick up the sibling's writes. A record with no
readable `repository_delta` refuses too. See
